  |       |
  |       v
  |   SKIP
  |   AI API NOT CALLED
  |
  v
Call MAIN cloud AI
  |
  v
Wait until full response OR timeout
  |
  v
Validate JSON signal
  |
  +-- HOLD / low confidence / invalid
  |       |
  |       v
  |   SKIP
  |   Risk AI NOT CALLED
  |
  v
Calculate lot + virtual SL/TP plan
  |
  v
If ENABLE_RISK_REVIEW=True
  |
  v
Call RISK cloud AI
  |
  v
Wait until full response OR timeout
  |
  +-- rejected / timeout / invalid JSON
  |       |
  |       v
  |   SKIP trade
  |
  v
Place order in MT5
  |
  v
Save virtual exit plan into trade memory + Supabase
  |
  v
Save pattern usage snapshot into trade memory + Supabase
  |
  v
Log trade
  |
  v
Sleep LOOP_INTERVAL
```

Rule penting:
- AI call mesti blocking.
- Hanya satu AI call boleh jalan dalam satu masa.
- Main AI mesti siap dahulu sebelum risk AI.
- Risk AI mesti siap dahulu sebelum order dihantar.
- Kalau cooling-off, AI tidak dipanggil langsung.
- Bot mesti jaga setiap open ticket sampai trade tamat.
- SL/TP/trailing stop tidak dihantar sebagai fixed broker-side level ke MT5.
- Exit dilakukan oleh bot melalui close order apabila virtual trigger kena.

