## 12. Error Handling

Kalau cloud AI gagal:
```text
Connection error -> HOLD / skip
Timeout -> HOLD / skip
Invalid JSON -> HOLD / skip
Rate limit -> retry, then skip
Risk review fail -> reject trade by default
Supabase sync fail -> continue local trading, log warning
Pattern usage sync fail -> continue local trading, log warning
Virtual exit trigger fail to close -> retry, alert dashboard
```

Trading safety rule:
- Kalau AI tidak beri JSON valid, jangan trade.
- Kalau risk AI enabled tapi gagal, jangan trade.
- Jangan fallback kepada random/default BUY/SELL.
- Kalau virtual SL/TP/trailing trigger kena tetapi MT5 close gagal, retry dan mark trade as `close_failed`.
- Jika laptop offline, Vercel dashboard hanya manual guide; no automatic execution.

